# M-SOV05 -- W2-CA-02 PlayerControl houses. SOV05u: the Tesla Troopers of the
# PlayerControl house Other3 obey the player's move order onto the Paris Tower
# cells -> 'Player Near Tower' (EnteredBy Other3) -> Tower Energized -> win
# timer -> WON. Cheats: three Other3 troopers placed near the tower and the
# Allied houses removed (combat skip); the move is the real World order.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov05u.MAP Nod

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
until 900 objectives >= 1
cheat camp_spawn SHK 7 47 36 3
wait 5
cheat camp_move SHK 45 31
until 900 objectives >= 2
cheat kill_house 1
cheat kill_house 2
wait 300
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat kill_house 1
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat kill_house 2
until 3000 outcome == WON
assert outcome == WON
